# ── Tauri (native desktop + mobile) ──
# Rust build output. Rebuildable, and enormous.
src-tauri/target/

# The Android and iOS projects are generated from tauri.conf.json and
# Cargo.toml by `tauri android init` / `tauri ios init`. Committing them means
# two sources of truth that disagree after the first config change, and the
# generated Gradle and Xcode files churn on every toolchain bump.
src-tauri/gen/android/
src-tauri/gen/apple/

# The JSON schemas are regenerated from the capabilities on every build. The
# capability files reference them via $schema for editor autocomplete, which
# resolves after the first build — this matches the upstream Tauri template.
src-tauri/gen/schemas/
